{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed translation scope",
      "text": "Service order: Hindi-to-English document translation\nSeller: Nira Vale, India\nBuyer: Emon Tarel\nAgreed fee: EUR 180\n\nRequirements:\n- Translate the four-page Hindi vendor agreement into English.\n- Deliver the translation as an editable DOCX file.\n- Provide a separate glossary of recurring commercial terms.\n- Preserve the source document's numbered clause structure.\n\nThe buyer supplied the source document before work began. The fee covers the requirements above and one round of corrections to translation errors reported within seven days of delivery. It does not include legal advice or certification. Both parties accepted this scope before the seller started work."
    },
    {
      "title": "Delivery handover",
      "text": "From: Nira Vale\nTo: Emon Tarel\nSubject: Translation handover\n\nI have delivered the files through our agreed shared folder. The handover contains:\n\nagreement-english.docx — English translation of all four pages of the Hindi vendor agreement; editable DOCX file.\nsource-agreement.pdf — the four-page Hindi source supplied by the buyer, included for reference.\n\nThe translation file contains the English text for review. Please check it against your intended commercial terminology and send me any translation errors within seven days. The shared folder contains only the two files listed above. The contents of the translation file are not reproduced in this handover note."
    },
    {
      "title": "Chat after delivery",
      "text": "Emon, 14:10: I opened the English document, thank you. I can edit it and see the translation of all four pages.\n\nEmon, 14:12: I cannot find the separate terminology glossary in the folder. Was it sent elsewhere?\n\nNira, 14:18: No. I did not prepare or deliver the separate glossary. I am sorry; I can send it tomorrow if you still need it.\n\nEmon, 14:22: Please do. I will review the translation against the source this evening and let you know about any wording corrections.\n\nNira, 14:25: That works. Please send any correction requests within the seven-day review period."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
